{"id":"presentimiento","lemma":"presentimiento","pos":"noun","rank":2726,"glosses":["presentiment, foreboding","gut feeling, hunch","premonition"],"ipa":"/pɾesentiˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"presentimientos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-presentimiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Solo era un presentimiento.","en":"It was just a hunch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800198","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tuve el presentimiento de que harías eso.","en":"I had a hunch you would do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804329","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"Seguía un presentimiento.","en":"I was following a hunch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804325","words":[{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tengo el presentimiento de que algo ha salido mal.","en":"I've got a feeling something's gone wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599247","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"sticking out"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"Tuve el presentimiento de que algo no iba bien.","en":"I had a premonition that something wasn't right.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"well"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]}]}